  "description": "*“I used to wish you’d just disappear. But I never thought it would actually happen.”*\n\nYun-Jeong, who wants to live a brilliant life marked by excellent grades and clear goals. Her older sister Eun-Ah, who longed for a simple, unassuming life without ambition. And Cheol-Yun, the man who became deeply entangled in the lives of the two sisters. Ju-Hwan, who had been quietly by Yun-Jeong’s side for a long time. Fate binds the hearts of the four together, leaving behind wounds that can never be healed. \n\nA predetermined future, family expectations, and conflicting desires lead to an irreversible catastrophe. The secrets of these three people and the guilt they carry are passed down, casting a shadow over the next generation…\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
